WEBVTT

01:33.400 --> 01:35.671
(Adapted from the web novel "Waiting for You in a City")

01:35.731 --> 01:38.031
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:38.100 --> 01:41.001
(Episode 32)

01:51.350 --> 01:52.180
Let's go home.

01:54.020 --> 01:54.680
Are you hungry?

01:55.650 --> 01:56.421
Let's eat something.

01:59.260 --> 02:00.691
Did Aunt make supper?

02:02.731 --> 02:03.861
Let's not eat with them.

02:04.731 --> 02:05.630
Just the two of us.

02:14.540 --> 02:16.271
(You miss a city because someone you miss is there)

02:31.221 --> 02:32.061
I want more.

02:40.160 --> 02:40.961
Here.

03:03.091 --> 03:03.890
What's the matter?

03:04.721 --> 03:05.920
Do you have to drink to talk?

03:07.320 --> 03:08.660
I want to drink a bit.

03:09.360 --> 03:10.961
I'm not afraid since you're here anyway.

03:11.130 --> 03:12.760
Don't drink like this with others.

03:13.931 --> 03:14.760
Got it.

03:14.830 --> 03:16.070
I'll only drink with you.

03:34.850 --> 03:36.491
Do you really like your current job?

03:38.221 --> 03:40.260
Is it maybe because it's more noble?

03:44.561 --> 03:45.660
To be honest,

03:46.360 --> 03:47.660
it's because I'm saving lives.

03:47.730 --> 03:48.901
That's why I couldn't leave.

03:49.271 --> 03:51.031
I really don't think about being noble...

03:51.100 --> 03:52.170
or making a contribution.

03:53.100 --> 03:53.901
I don't.

03:54.540 --> 03:55.941
Sometimes, it's quite tiring.

03:56.811 --> 03:57.871
It's just one thing.

03:57.941 --> 03:59.811
Since I'm doing it, I'll just do it well.

04:00.711 --> 04:01.781
It's my duty.

04:01.850 --> 04:03.211
I just need to take responsibility.

04:03.610 --> 04:04.311
Here.

04:13.991 --> 04:16.491
That day, after work,

04:17.830 --> 04:19.431
Uncle and Aunt came to pick me up.

04:19.501 --> 04:20.431
Do you know that?

04:21.200 --> 04:22.001
I do.

04:26.171 --> 04:27.340
But you don't know...

04:28.970 --> 04:30.510
that Aunt held my hand.

04:31.981 --> 04:33.140
She said...

04:34.510 --> 04:35.611
my hand was cold.

04:36.450 --> 04:37.611
She wanted to warm it for me.

04:42.921 --> 04:44.020
Your whole family...

04:45.890 --> 04:47.691
treats me quite well.

04:50.890 --> 04:51.630
Song Yan.

04:53.861 --> 04:55.371
I told you before.

04:56.270 --> 04:58.601
I said it's nice to live in your house.

04:59.001 --> 04:59.900
Do you remember?

05:03.840 --> 05:05.411
I didn't know better back then.

05:06.510 --> 05:09.650
I just said how I felt.

05:10.010 --> 05:11.650
But I know better now.

05:12.851 --> 05:14.150
I still think...

05:16.520 --> 05:18.121
it's great to live in your house.

05:21.191 --> 05:22.030
Uncle,

05:22.931 --> 05:23.830
Aunt,

05:25.061 --> 05:25.760
and Zhai Miao...

05:27.061 --> 05:28.101
are all great.

05:28.970 --> 05:30.200
I like them all.

05:32.301 --> 05:33.171
It's true.

05:34.270 --> 05:35.640
I really like them.

05:36.840 --> 05:37.840
I like them a lot.

05:48.421 --> 05:49.791
I like them.

05:50.621 --> 05:51.720
They're good to me...

05:52.491 --> 05:53.460
all because of you.

06:05.140 --> 06:06.200
One day,

06:09.311 --> 06:10.710
if you're really gone,

06:11.371 --> 06:12.380
then they...

06:14.080 --> 06:15.851
have nothing to do with me anymore.

06:19.551 --> 06:20.851
I'll still be alone.

06:21.691 --> 06:22.520
Do you understand?

06:24.450 --> 06:25.161
Xu Qin.

06:26.691 --> 06:28.260
Let me finish first.

06:30.431 --> 06:31.931
I'm afraid that if I don't say it now,

06:33.630 --> 06:35.130
I won't say it again.

06:40.070 --> 06:41.140
I've already made up my mind.

06:41.970 --> 06:42.970
Someday,

06:43.640 --> 06:45.181
if something really happens to you,

06:50.051 --> 06:50.950
then I'll...

06:58.520 --> 07:00.291
You can think I'm dramatic.

07:02.030 --> 07:04.330
You can think I'm weak and useless too.

07:06.330 --> 07:07.460
Or maybe you're thinking...

07:10.400 --> 07:11.801
that I'm threatening you...

07:13.400 --> 07:14.541
and you want to be angry.

07:15.210 --> 07:16.411
But you know what?

07:18.441 --> 07:19.181
That day,

07:22.751 --> 07:24.950
when I was resuscitating you in the emergency room,

07:29.851 --> 07:31.051
it hurt so much.

07:32.520 --> 07:33.661
I couldn't stand it.

07:34.121 --> 07:35.760
I couldn't get through it.

08:08.320 --> 08:09.061
Xu Qin.

08:10.861 --> 08:11.731
I might...

08:13.161 --> 08:14.030
transfer to another unit.

08:24.347 --> 08:25.620
My job might change.

08:26.441 --> 08:27.741
The timeline hasn't been decided yet.

08:28.580 --> 08:31.181
That's why I haven't had time to tell you.

08:32.150 --> 08:33.251
Since last year,

08:33.751 --> 08:34.481
I've been trying hard...

08:34.551 --> 08:36.520
to make more adjustments and changes.

08:37.491 --> 08:38.220
First,

08:38.520 --> 08:39.921
I've realized from working all these years...

08:40.521 --> 08:41.720
that the reduction of injury rate...

08:42.161 --> 08:43.761
is related to professional training.

08:44.460 --> 08:46.730
And most rescue casualties can be avoided.

08:47.061 --> 08:48.700
Whether it's improving the training system...

08:48.970 --> 08:50.200
or optimizing the rescue philosophy,

08:50.271 --> 08:51.470
means, and methods,

08:53.171 --> 08:54.000
it needs to be done...

08:54.070 --> 08:55.641
by someone with experience in the front line.

09:01.110 --> 09:01.950
Second,

09:05.881 --> 09:06.580
it's because of you.

10:01.041 --> 10:01.700
Aunt.

10:01.970 --> 10:02.911
What happened to her?

10:03.570 --> 10:04.240
She's fine.

10:04.610 --> 10:05.641
She just had a few drinks.

10:05.710 --> 10:06.441
She drank too fast.

10:06.511 --> 10:07.681
She'll be fine after a while.

10:09.051 --> 10:09.811
Is she really okay?

10:09.881 --> 10:10.811
Yes.

10:17.979 --> 10:18.920
Take care.

10:20.120 --> 10:20.819
Good night.

12:48.030 --> 12:48.870
Are you awake?

12:51.739 --> 12:52.969
I wasn't drunk.

12:56.143 --> 12:57.013
You said...

12:58.482 --> 12:59.783
it's also because of me.

13:09.123 --> 13:10.163
Xu Qin.

13:12.863 --> 13:14.903
I've thought about our future.

13:17.602 --> 13:18.533
At that time,

13:19.673 --> 13:21.102
we'll be living in our house.

13:21.873 --> 13:23.003
We'll buy a new car.

13:24.842 --> 13:26.043
I'll be working regular hours...

13:26.442 --> 13:27.383
from 9 to 5.

13:28.783 --> 13:30.212
I'll have breakfast with you in the morning,

13:30.812 --> 13:32.013
take you to work,

13:32.482 --> 13:33.582
and pick you up after work.

13:35.482 --> 13:36.482
We'll cook together,

13:37.222 --> 13:38.052
watch movies,

13:39.092 --> 13:40.023
go shopping,

13:41.293 --> 13:42.322
plant flowers,

13:43.222 --> 13:44.332
and have a pet.

13:46.832 --> 13:49.533
On weekends, we'll travel somewhere nearby.

13:49.932 --> 13:51.003
On our annual leave,

13:51.072 --> 13:52.572
let's travel farther away.

13:54.543 --> 13:55.572
If we're tired...

13:55.702 --> 13:57.373
or lazy and don't want to go out,

13:58.613 --> 13:59.942
we'll just stay at home,

14:00.743 --> 14:02.513
lie in bed, and get some sun.

14:02.783 --> 14:03.753
We won't go anywhere.

14:09.182 --> 14:10.322
Just the two of us.

14:20.033 --> 14:21.462
Do you want to spend such days with me?

14:29.373 --> 14:30.373
Yes.

14:32.712 --> 14:34.043
I do.

14:36.982 --> 14:38.283
Yes.

14:38.613 --> 14:39.883
I do.

14:54.903 --> 14:56.102
It's snowing quite heavily.

14:59.173 --> 15:00.302
Didn't you say...

15:00.373 --> 15:01.873
that Xu Qin drank last night?

15:02.572 --> 15:04.312
Could they have fought?

15:04.613 --> 15:05.413
No.

15:05.543 --> 15:07.113
I took a look from the window earlier.

15:07.182 --> 15:08.043
They're not up yet.

15:08.113 --> 15:09.143
They're not up yet?

15:09.582 --> 15:10.552
They're not up yet.

15:10.753 --> 15:12.283
They're very sweet.

15:14.182 --> 15:15.082
I think...

15:15.153 --> 15:15.923
they had a fight before...

15:15.982 --> 15:17.552
because they hadn't seen each other for a long time.

15:17.623 --> 15:18.623
They miss each other so much.

15:20.023 --> 15:21.793
If they decide to get married,

15:21.863 --> 15:22.692
that will be great.

15:22.822 --> 15:24.263
It's time for them to settle down.

15:24.432 --> 15:26.092
I can't wait to have grandchildren.

15:28.302 --> 15:30.163
You drew the cabinet nicely.

15:30.232 --> 15:31.102
Of course.

15:31.403 --> 15:33.003
Based on my skill,

15:33.373 --> 15:34.403
my carpentry work...

15:34.472 --> 15:36.342
is better than those at the furniture store.

15:37.373 --> 15:38.273
That's for sure.

15:38.342 --> 15:39.543
The Zhai family's carpentry skills...

15:39.613 --> 15:41.013
have been passed down for years.

15:41.243 --> 15:42.783
I'm sure Qin Qin will like...

15:43.143 --> 15:44.452
your cabinet.

15:44.613 --> 15:45.383
Of course.

15:48.253 --> 15:49.352
This time,

15:49.423 --> 15:50.352
Yan Er...

15:50.423 --> 15:52.452
really invested everything he got.

15:57.332 --> 15:59.133
Song Yan, it's snowing!

15:59.863 --> 16:00.863
They're up.

16:23.893 --> 16:24.822
It's so beautiful.

16:27.023 --> 16:28.562
The snow isn't too heavy yet.

16:28.623 --> 16:29.993
In 2 or 3 weeks,

16:30.462 --> 16:31.332
it'll be even thicker.

16:31.893 --> 16:32.663
When the time comes,

16:32.863 --> 16:34.263
I'll build you a snowman.

16:47.313 --> 16:48.043
Song Yan.

16:52.052 --> 16:53.182
When you crouched on the ground,

16:53.253 --> 16:55.423
I knew what you wanted to do by looking at the back of your head.

16:57.053 --> 16:58.692
Here, I'll put out the fire for you.

16:59.222 --> 17:00.192
It's cold!

17:03.022 --> 17:03.833
What do you think?

17:04.032 --> 17:04.893
Are they okay?

17:05.292 --> 17:06.462
They're in a great mood.

17:11.202 --> 17:13.173
All right, let's go back.

17:19.913 --> 17:21.012
All right.

17:45.403 --> 17:46.303
Wait.

17:47.133 --> 17:48.972
Let's choose some companions for the fish at home.

17:51.212 --> 17:52.143
Come on, miss.

17:54.313 --> 17:55.383
Take your pick.

17:56.512 --> 17:57.853
They're all alive.

18:04.323 --> 18:05.022
Take a look.

18:05.123 --> 18:06.022
This one...

18:06.093 --> 18:07.192
is shaped like a lion's head.

18:07.393 --> 18:08.692
This one is shaped like a tiger's head.

18:09.492 --> 18:10.762
We want one of each.

18:11.093 --> 18:12.192
- One of each, right? - Yes.

18:12.262 --> 18:13.093
All right.

18:22.272 --> 18:23.772
I like the smell of Wufang Street.

18:24.212 --> 18:25.012
What smell is it?

18:26.143 --> 18:27.042
Your smell.

18:28.413 --> 18:29.343
What smell do I have?

18:30.653 --> 18:32.282
The smell of the hustle and bustle of life.

18:34.653 --> 18:35.452
What a pity.

18:36.053 --> 18:37.452
Wufang Street will be demolished soon.

18:37.923 --> 18:39.452
I'll miss this place.

18:39.923 --> 18:40.863
I'll miss it too.

18:42.093 --> 18:42.823
Xu Qin.

18:43.762 --> 18:45.262
It's time for us to have our own home.

18:46.462 --> 18:47.163
Tell me.

18:47.732 --> 18:49.303
What do you think our own house...

18:49.563 --> 18:50.532
will be like?

18:52.502 --> 18:54.103
I prefer a small, old-style structure.

18:54.403 --> 18:56.303
It doesn't have to be too big, but it's cozy.

18:57.242 --> 18:58.613
It's better if it's closer to your work.

18:59.242 --> 18:59.972
A house like Uncle's...

19:00.042 --> 19:02.512
should only be available on Fireworks Street.

19:02.913 --> 19:03.952
And I think that area is included...

19:04.012 --> 19:05.413
in the city's historic conservation area.

19:06.053 --> 19:07.623
How can we afford it now?

19:09.153 --> 19:09.823
That's right.

19:10.792 --> 19:12.222
Let's look at real estate then.

19:13.323 --> 19:14.462
I'm getting a raise.

19:14.522 --> 19:15.623
If the demolition is urgent,

19:15.692 --> 19:17.333
we can rent a house first.

19:17.732 --> 19:18.732
Don't worry.

19:19.262 --> 19:19.962
Hold on tight, baby.

19:20.032 --> 19:20.762
Let's go home.

19:35.982 --> 19:36.913
Look at its mouth.

19:39.353 --> 19:40.182
It looks like yours.

19:57.603 --> 19:58.303
Dad.

19:58.373 --> 19:59.833
Put more eggs in the filling.

19:59.903 --> 20:00.942
Don't worry, my daughter.

20:02.002 --> 20:03.242
Go help your sister-in-law.

20:07.173 --> 20:07.843
Xu Qin.

20:08.383 --> 20:09.742
Is there anything I can help with?

20:10.012 --> 20:10.682
There's no need.

20:10.752 --> 20:11.883
Just one more to go.

20:13.212 --> 20:13.982
Zhai Miao.

20:15.022 --> 20:15.823
Yes.

20:23.123 --> 20:23.923
What's the matter?

20:24.532 --> 20:25.692
Paste the Guardian God.

20:26.032 --> 20:27.232
So early?

20:27.292 --> 20:28.063
Didn't Song Yan tell us...

20:28.133 --> 20:28.962
to wait for him to do it when he comes back?

20:29.032 --> 20:29.903
Wait for him?

20:29.962 --> 20:31.073
It has been over a decade.

20:31.133 --> 20:32.633
When has he ever come back for New Year's Eve dinner?

20:32.702 --> 20:33.373
We'll wait for him?

20:34.002 --> 20:35.272
Isn't Xu Qin here?

20:35.343 --> 20:37.042
If she's here, he'll come back.

20:37.286 --> 20:38.417
Yes, I'm here this year.

20:38.442 --> 20:39.113
I'll do it.

20:39.173 --> 20:40.942
Okay. Here, Xiao Qin.

20:41.421 --> 20:42.320
Here, Miao Miao.

20:42.613 --> 20:43.313
All right.

20:43.383 --> 20:44.053
Paste them well.

20:44.113 --> 20:44.782
Okay.

20:48.083 --> 20:48.752
Come on.

21:04.603 --> 21:05.272
Okay.

21:06.303 --> 21:07.133
- All right. - Let's go.

21:08.272 --> 21:09.143
The filling is done.

21:09.202 --> 21:10.472
Come in and make dumplings.

21:10.673 --> 21:11.673
- Okay. - Let's make dumplings.

21:11.742 --> 21:12.512
I'm coming.

21:12.843 --> 21:13.542
Come on.

21:19.782 --> 21:21.383
(Fortune)

21:41.143 --> 21:42.242
(Fortune, prosperity)

21:45.873 --> 21:47.913
(Fortune)

21:47.982 --> 21:49.643
(Exemplary practice)

21:53.853 --> 21:54.782
The food today must be delicious.

21:54.853 --> 21:55.752
Da Peng.

21:57.222 --> 21:59.292
- Happy New Year. - Happy New Year.

21:59.692 --> 22:00.353
- Happy New Year. - Happy New Year.

22:01.423 --> 22:02.663
- Happy New Year. - Happy New Year.

22:02.722 --> 22:03.992
Let's eat dumplings.

22:06.093 --> 22:06.762
The dumplings are here.

22:06.833 --> 22:07.502
Hurry up.

22:07.903 --> 22:09.462
- Place it there. - Let's eat.

22:14.673 --> 22:15.343
Yang Chi.

22:15.803 --> 22:17.373
It's my first time eating while wearing our turnout gear.

22:17.442 --> 22:18.573
I'm really not used to it.

22:19.613 --> 22:20.272
Let me tell you.

22:20.343 --> 22:22.042
This year, we have to be on standby.

22:22.143 --> 22:23.583
Let's finish eating soon and get ready.

22:23.643 --> 22:24.313
Right?

22:24.782 --> 22:26.153
Besides, wearing our turnout gear...

22:26.212 --> 22:26.913
while eating New Year's Eve dinner...

22:26.982 --> 22:29.022
is the firefighters' sense of ritual.

22:29.252 --> 22:30.252
To ordinary people,

22:30.323 --> 22:31.393
the New Year is a festival.

22:31.452 --> 22:32.593
But to us firefighters,

22:32.653 --> 22:33.992
the New Year is an ordeal we must pass.

22:34.053 --> 22:35.093
Okay, let's eat dumplings.

22:35.163 --> 22:35.823
- Okay. - Okay.

22:35.893 --> 22:36.563
- Come on. - Come on.

22:36.623 --> 22:37.292
You don't say.

22:37.363 --> 22:38.063
Jiang Yi is not around.

22:38.133 --> 22:39.093
I really miss him.

22:39.163 --> 22:39.893
Why do you miss him?

22:39.962 --> 22:40.762
It's not like he has no dumplings to eat.

22:40.833 --> 22:41.532
Just eat.

22:42.462 --> 22:43.133
How is it?

22:43.202 --> 22:44.903
- It's good. - Delicious.

22:47.103 --> 22:48.002
Come on, stand up.

22:49.373 --> 22:50.643
Hello, Instructor. Hello, Chief.

22:50.702 --> 22:52.813
- Hello, Instructor. Hello, Chief. - Hello, Instructor. Hello, Chief.

22:53.042 --> 22:53.913
Happy New Year.

22:53.972 --> 22:55.782
- Happy New Year. - Happy New Year.

22:55.843 --> 22:56.982
Instructor, you're so nice.

22:57.042 --> 22:58.182
You even prepared red packets for us.

22:58.353 --> 23:00.383
- Your eyes are quite sharp. - Really?

23:00.553 --> 23:01.623
Red packet!

23:01.682 --> 23:02.823
Hold on.

23:02.982 --> 23:04.292
It's New Year's today.

23:04.492 --> 23:06.323
Let's ask Chief Song to say a few words.

23:06.492 --> 23:07.823
- Okay. - Okay.

23:08.893 --> 23:09.593
Have a seat.

23:14.262 --> 23:15.532
This year,

23:16.163 --> 23:17.462
everyone did well.

23:18.103 --> 23:19.702
You protected the honor of Shilitai.

23:20.403 --> 23:21.303
As the chief,

23:21.942 --> 23:23.573
I've seen the growth of the new team members...

23:24.573 --> 23:26.742
and also the perseverance of the old team members.

23:27.542 --> 23:28.413
I feel very happy.

23:29.343 --> 23:30.442
It's New Year's Eve.

23:30.742 --> 23:32.482
Whether you're on the front line...

23:32.752 --> 23:33.952
or supporting from the rear,

23:34.353 --> 23:35.583
keep your spirits up...

23:35.682 --> 23:37.282
and be ready, okay?

23:37.452 --> 23:38.722
- Okay. - Okay.

23:44.692 --> 23:45.732
Good job, guys.

23:46.133 --> 23:46.893
Happy New Year.

23:46.962 --> 23:49.502
- Happy New Year. - Happy New Year.

23:53.673 --> 23:55.843
Red packets.

23:55.903 --> 23:57.502
It's time to test you.

23:59.413 --> 24:01.383
Do you all want red packets?

24:01.442 --> 24:02.712
- Yes! - Yes!

24:02.782 --> 24:03.482
Okay.

24:03.613 --> 24:05.553
Everyone, recite a poem...

24:05.613 --> 24:06.613
with the word "spring".

24:07.452 --> 24:09.682
I knew the instructor's red packets wouldn't be so easy to get.

24:09.752 --> 24:11.123
- That's right. - Right.

24:11.692 --> 24:12.492
I'll go first.

24:12.823 --> 24:13.992
Waking up from a good sleep in spring,

24:14.053 --> 24:15.522
I hear birds chirping everywhere.

24:15.962 --> 24:17.563
- Nice. - Great.

24:17.692 --> 24:18.532
- You... - The garden scenery in spring...

24:18.593 --> 24:19.262
cannot be locked up.

24:19.333 --> 24:20.563
A branch of red apricot in full bloom sticks out of the wall.

24:20.633 --> 24:21.532
- Here. - Nice.

24:21.633 --> 24:22.932
When the grass turns green in spring next year,

24:23.032 --> 24:24.232
will you be coming back here?

24:24.303 --> 24:25.002
Great.

24:25.073 --> 24:26.472
I don't know where the girl I love went,

24:26.532 --> 24:28.202
but the peach blossoms are still smiling in the spring breeze.

24:28.272 --> 24:28.972
Nice.

25:02.472 --> 25:03.903
Come on, let's have another toast.

25:03.972 --> 25:05.373
- Here, cheers. - Come on.

25:05.442 --> 25:06.272
Happy New Year.

25:06.343 --> 25:07.113
- Happy New Year. - Yes.

25:07.173 --> 25:08.242
To a better life.

25:08.313 --> 25:09.583
I wish you more happiness too.

25:13.257 --> 25:14.257
Here, Mom. Have a dumpling.

25:14.282 --> 25:15.623
All right. Thank you, my daughter.

25:15.752 --> 25:16.823
How's the filling?

25:16.883 --> 25:17.923
- Good, the dumplings are great. - I know, right?

25:18.022 --> 25:19.053
Qin Qin, eat more.

25:19.323 --> 25:20.593
Here, I'll give you another bowl of dumplings.

25:22.022 --> 25:22.792
Eat more.

25:23.093 --> 25:24.222
I've been eating too much good food these days.

25:24.292 --> 25:25.363
My face has become round.

25:25.532 --> 25:26.608
- Yes. - It's good to have a rounder face.

25:26.633 --> 25:27.633
There are so many different fillings.

25:29.163 --> 25:30.663
Dear viewers.

25:30.732 --> 25:31.903
In this beautiful time...

25:31.972 --> 25:33.232
to ring out the old year and ring in the new year,

25:33.257 --> 25:34.696
we're gathered here...

25:34.762 --> 25:36.802
to welcome the New Year.

25:46.012 --> 25:47.542
(Unified command)

25:47.612 --> 25:49.241
(Regular and specialized skills, quick response)

25:49.312 --> 25:50.882
(Integrated operation)

25:50.941 --> 25:52.552
(Systems used both in war and peace)

25:52.612 --> 25:53.481
(Fortune, prosperity)

25:53.552 --> 25:54.882
Hello, 119. Go ahead.

25:55.822 --> 25:58.421
Dad. When are you coming home?

26:00.691 --> 26:01.622
Hey, kid.

26:02.062 --> 26:03.891
This is the 119 fire report line.

26:04.062 --> 26:05.762
Did you dial the wrong number?

26:05.931 --> 26:08.431
Xiao Kui, who are you talking to?

26:09.032 --> 26:10.701
Dad. I want to talk to my dad.

26:11.931 --> 26:12.731
I'm really sorry.

26:12.802 --> 26:14.001
My child dialed the wrong number.

26:14.342 --> 26:15.701
Her dad is a firefighter.

26:15.872 --> 26:17.241
Maybe she misses her dad.

26:17.401 --> 26:18.612
I'm really sorry.

26:20.911 --> 26:21.941
It's okay, ma'am.

26:23.211 --> 26:24.141
Xiao Kui.

26:24.782 --> 26:25.782
Happy New Year.

26:26.012 --> 26:27.681
Thank you. Happy New Year.

26:31.592 --> 26:32.622
(Rapid report reception)

26:32.691 --> 26:33.792
(Precise dispatch, scientific direction)

26:33.852 --> 26:39.062
(Yanjiang Restaurant)

26:46.302 --> 26:49.501
(Yanjiang Restaurant)

27:12.092 --> 27:16.062
(Handmade dumplings)

27:27.171 --> 27:27.941
Ma'am.

27:28.241 --> 27:29.241
One dumpling, please.

27:30.441 --> 27:31.382
I'm sorry.

27:31.751 --> 27:33.852
We're out of dumplings. How about noodles?

27:38.292 --> 27:38.991
No, Mom.

27:42.092 --> 27:43.421
I just want to eat your dumplings.

27:45.132 --> 27:46.092
My son.

27:46.231 --> 27:46.891
Mom.

27:46.961 --> 27:47.901
My son.

27:48.862 --> 27:50.032
You're back.

27:50.532 --> 27:51.901
My son is back.

27:51.971 --> 27:52.701
I missed you.

27:52.772 --> 27:53.701
I missed you so much.

27:56.572 --> 27:57.971
My son is back.

27:59.711 --> 28:00.971
Look at you.

28:01.042 --> 28:03.042
Why didn't you tell me you were coming back?

28:03.112 --> 28:04.312
I could've prepared.

28:04.382 --> 28:05.211
Mom.

28:05.852 --> 28:07.082
I was afraid I'd have a mission...

28:07.181 --> 28:07.951
and there'd be a last-minute change in plans,

28:08.022 --> 28:09.082
so I didn't dare to tell you.

28:09.251 --> 28:10.721
I was afraid you'd be disappointed if I told you.

28:12.921 --> 28:14.191
This is great.

28:14.592 --> 28:16.122
This is so nice.

28:18.762 --> 28:19.632
You haven't eaten, right?

28:19.691 --> 28:21.032
- No. - I'll make dumplings for you.

28:21.092 --> 28:21.862
I'll make them with you.

28:21.931 --> 28:22.931
Okay.

28:35.112 --> 28:37.112
I went downstairs to buy soy sauce...

28:37.181 --> 28:38.981
and I forgot my keys.

28:39.052 --> 28:40.852
My son can't come home either.

28:40.981 --> 28:41.822
In the thermal company,

28:41.882 --> 28:43.022
he has to work during New Year's.

28:43.082 --> 28:44.221
Sorry for troubling you guys.

28:44.282 --> 28:44.991
- It's fine. - It's here.

28:45.191 --> 28:46.522
- Here. - What are you cooking inside?

28:46.592 --> 28:47.622
Why is there smoke?

28:48.022 --> 28:48.991
My goodness.

28:49.062 --> 28:50.691
My braised pork.

28:50.762 --> 28:53.292
- Hurry up. - Gosh, hurry.

28:54.461 --> 28:55.461
I'm so anxious.

28:58.001 --> 28:58.872
Come on, hurry.

29:05.171 --> 29:06.141
Open the window.

29:09.342 --> 29:10.141
It's okay.

29:11.651 --> 29:12.352
Ma'am.

29:13.052 --> 29:14.451
Your pork is wasted.

29:16.221 --> 29:17.721
It's fine as long as there's no big trouble.

29:17.782 --> 29:18.721
I was so scared.

29:18.792 --> 29:19.721
It's fine now.

29:20.451 --> 29:21.122
The lock is broken.

29:21.191 --> 29:22.661
We'll replace it later.

29:22.721 --> 29:23.762
Thank you.

29:25.231 --> 29:25.891
Ma'am.

29:26.362 --> 29:27.691
Why didn't you paste this horizontal scroll?

29:27.762 --> 29:28.431
(Peace and prosperity)

29:29.032 --> 29:31.272
It's too high. I can't reach it.

29:31.931 --> 29:34.072
I'm afraid I'll fall if I stand on the stool.

29:39.241 --> 29:40.012
Come on, let me do it.

29:40.112 --> 29:41.072
- Thanks, ma'am. I don't eat candy. - Have some candy.

29:41.141 --> 29:42.882
- I can't eat it. - Take it. It's the New Year. Here.

29:42.941 --> 29:44.312
- Here, have a piece. - Thank you, ma'am.

29:44.382 --> 29:45.651
Ma'am, you're too kind. We really can't take it.

29:45.751 --> 29:47.012
- Thank you, ma'am. Happy New Year. - Have some.

29:47.082 --> 29:47.812
Have some candy.

29:47.981 --> 29:49.651
Ma'am, we really can't take it. We really can't.

29:50.022 --> 29:51.991
- You must have some candy. - This is our job.

29:52.052 --> 29:52.721
- Take it. - Thank you, ma'am.

29:53.092 --> 29:54.322
You must eat tangerines.

29:54.491 --> 29:55.292
The tangerines.

29:56.191 --> 29:56.862
Child.

29:56.921 --> 29:57.822
Ma'am.

29:57.931 --> 29:58.832
The people's business...

29:58.891 --> 30:00.062
is the firefighters' business.

30:00.177 --> 30:00.837
If you need anything,

30:00.862 --> 30:01.661
just call us.

30:01.731 --> 30:02.461
Happy New Year.

30:03.562 --> 30:04.362
Thank you.

30:06.272 --> 30:07.471
Take this. Take the tangerines.

30:07.532 --> 30:09.001
Ma'am, we can't take these. We can't.

30:09.072 --> 30:09.741
Be good.

30:09.802 --> 30:11.441
I'll get mad if you don't take them.

30:11.512 --> 30:12.542
I'll take one then.

30:12.612 --> 30:13.372
I'll take one.

30:13.441 --> 30:14.612
- I'll just take one. - Take them all.

30:14.812 --> 30:16.112
- Take them all. - Thank you, ma'am.

30:16.181 --> 30:17.542
Happy New Year, ma'am.

30:17.741 --> 30:18.411
You...

30:18.782 --> 30:19.651
Bye.

30:31.191 --> 30:32.491
Chief.

30:34.762 --> 30:36.001
The lady was too kind.

30:36.062 --> 30:37.001
I only took one.

30:37.802 --> 30:38.572
I'm handing it over to the collective.

30:57.582 --> 30:58.391
Thank you, Chief.

31:00.852 --> 31:01.661
Thank you, Chief.

31:04.862 --> 31:05.891
Thank you, Chief.

31:10.132 --> 31:10.931
Thank you, Chief.

31:15.342 --> 31:16.372
To the people,

31:16.901 --> 31:18.211
New Years must be spent with family.

31:18.941 --> 31:20.171
For us firefighters,

31:20.441 --> 31:21.612
as long as the people are safe,

31:22.042 --> 31:23.382
it's a happy New Year.

31:26.012 --> 31:27.411
In performing your duties on New Year's Eve this year,

31:27.852 --> 31:28.882
you all did well.

31:33.221 --> 31:34.391
It's a new year.

31:35.191 --> 31:35.891
Be safe.

31:36.921 --> 31:37.691
- Be safe. - Be safe.

31:37.762 --> 31:38.461
Be safe.

31:38.532 --> 31:39.191
Be safe.

31:47.671 --> 31:49.501
Did you buy the beef I like?

31:49.572 --> 31:50.901
I did. It's in the fridge.

31:51.102 --> 31:52.641
Make it for me tonight then.

31:52.711 --> 31:53.411
Okay.

31:56.512 --> 31:59.981
- Mom, Dad, we wish you good health. - Mom, Dad, we wish you good health.

32:00.052 --> 32:01.522
- Hope everything goes smoothly. - Hope everything goes smoothly.

32:01.582 --> 32:03.552
- May all your wishes come true. - May all your wishes come true.

32:03.822 --> 32:05.921
- Be kind and love each other. - Be kind and love each other.

32:06.221 --> 32:07.391
Thank you, kids.

32:07.451 --> 32:09.991
We wish you happiness and all the best to you too.

32:10.292 --> 32:11.632
Happy New Year.

32:11.691 --> 32:12.362
Cheers.

32:12.431 --> 32:14.062
- Happy New Year. - Happy New Year.

32:14.731 --> 32:15.431
Slow down.

32:15.532 --> 32:16.632
- Don't burn yourself. - It's hot.

32:17.201 --> 32:18.201
- It's so delicious. - Slow down.

32:18.302 --> 32:19.372
It still tastes the same.

32:19.602 --> 32:20.302
Have one too.

32:20.372 --> 32:21.072
Don't just watch me eat.

32:21.572 --> 32:22.441
I already ate.

32:22.501 --> 32:23.201
Have half of it.

32:23.372 --> 32:24.471
Half. Eat half of it.

32:24.602 --> 32:25.741
Bite it. All right.

32:32.211 --> 32:33.552
Kowtow to Grandpa and Grandma.

32:34.651 --> 32:35.822
- All right. - Good.

32:37.352 --> 32:40.451
- Happy New Year, Grandpa, Grandma. - Happy New Year, Grandpa, Grandma.

32:40.522 --> 32:42.092
- We wish you good health. - We wish you good health.

32:42.161 --> 32:43.522
- May everything go smoothly. - May everything go smoothly.

32:43.592 --> 32:44.262
- All right. - Okay.

32:44.322 --> 32:45.491
Come here quickly.

34:03.941 --> 34:11.242
(Fortune)

34:35.202 --> 34:36.501
Why are you sleeping here?

34:38.371 --> 34:39.711
I'm keeping a vigil.

34:40.171 --> 34:41.342
I was waiting for you to come back.

34:48.421 --> 34:49.822
Your shift is over.

34:50.052 --> 34:51.481
Go upstairs and get some sleep.

34:51.851 --> 34:52.691
I'm fine.

34:59.731 --> 35:00.662
You must be homesick.

35:03.231 --> 35:04.461
New Year is a big day.

35:05.271 --> 35:06.802
You should go home and see your parents.

35:11.302 --> 35:11.972
Don't be afraid.

35:13.912 --> 35:14.771
I'll go with you.

35:15.782 --> 35:17.481
You know my mom's temper.

35:18.481 --> 35:19.351
It's fine.

35:20.382 --> 35:21.621
I just want to bring you there...

35:21.751 --> 35:22.822
and pick you up.

35:23.651 --> 35:25.322
I don't want you to go back and forth alone.

35:26.092 --> 35:27.121
I'll wait for you outside.

35:27.851 --> 35:28.961
It's so cold outside.

35:29.021 --> 35:29.892
Don't worry.

35:30.492 --> 35:31.762
I'll find a warm place.

35:32.162 --> 35:32.892
I'll be fine.

35:37.901 --> 35:39.072
Happy New Year.

35:54.412 --> 35:55.882
All right, thank you.

36:05.662 --> 36:06.831
I'll walk around the museum across the street.

36:07.862 --> 36:09.432
Call me when you're done.

36:10.302 --> 36:11.262
I'm going in.

36:12.771 --> 36:13.601
Wait for me.

36:19.512 --> 36:20.311
Cheer up.

36:51.302 --> 36:52.012
Dad, Mom.

36:53.642 --> 36:55.412
Qin Qin, you're back.

37:00.981 --> 37:01.751
Huai Jin.

37:04.282 --> 37:05.992
Did you do what I told you?

37:07.222 --> 37:07.921
What is it?

37:10.621 --> 37:12.162
You never pay attention to what I say.

37:45.662 --> 37:46.561
What are you doing?

37:47.762 --> 37:48.762
When did you come back?

37:50.162 --> 37:50.932
Just now.

37:52.572 --> 37:54.001
Xiao Yi Xiao invited me to play tennis.

37:54.472 --> 37:55.142
Let's go.

37:59.335 --> 38:00.065
Yan Chen.

38:01.211 --> 38:02.782
We're going to eat soon.

38:03.211 --> 38:04.342
We'll be back soon.

38:05.682 --> 38:06.351
Let's go.

38:08.651 --> 38:10.021
Dad, Mom, I'll go ahead.

38:11.021 --> 38:11.751
Okay.

38:30.072 --> 38:31.202
Is his family nice to you?

38:32.112 --> 38:32.941
They're quite nice.

38:34.041 --> 38:34.811
They don't bully you, right?

38:42.751 --> 38:43.621
If he...

38:44.581 --> 38:45.822
or anyone bullies you,

38:46.691 --> 38:47.822
remember to tell me.

38:49.400 --> 38:50.771
If you really don't want to tell me,

38:51.932 --> 38:53.092
just tell Yi Xiao.

38:55.032 --> 38:55.762
Got it?

38:59.932 --> 39:00.671
Yes.

39:14.912 --> 39:15.621
Go.

39:28.532 --> 39:29.362
Good shot.

39:37.202 --> 39:38.371
I'll take a break and drink some water.

39:39.142 --> 39:39.972
Come on.

39:42.912 --> 39:43.612
Thank you.

39:49.382 --> 39:50.952
How is that guy treating you?

39:52.251 --> 39:54.921
Are you going to ask me the same thing my brother did?

39:57.722 --> 39:59.061
We're concerned about you.

39:59.492 --> 40:00.632
It's for your sake.

40:02.132 --> 40:02.831
Of course.

40:03.262 --> 40:04.932
What matters is that you're happy.

40:05.532 --> 40:06.702
I've always thought...

40:07.331 --> 40:08.072
that sooner or later,

40:08.132 --> 40:09.702
you'll end up with that Song guy.

40:10.702 --> 40:11.771
That's great hindsight.

40:13.711 --> 40:14.671
I've told him before.

40:14.742 --> 40:15.441
He wouldn't believe me.

40:19.151 --> 40:20.851
Xiao Yi Xiao, stop talking nonsense.

40:20.981 --> 40:21.682
Come and play.

40:22.382 --> 40:23.052
Coming.

40:25.851 --> 40:26.621
Come on.

40:26.892 --> 40:27.722
Let's continue.

40:34.162 --> 40:35.231
Good shot.

40:52.711 --> 40:56.851
(What are you doing now?)

40:56.921 --> 40:58.021
(I'm at the museum.)

40:58.081 --> 40:59.791
(No rush. Come out after eating with your parents.)

41:02.822 --> 41:05.121
(What about you?)

41:05.191 --> 41:09.032
(I'll walk around in the museum. Don't worry.)
